Copy File to Container on App Server 3
Problem: Copy an encrypted file /tmp/nautilus.txt.gpg from the docker host to the ubuntu_latest container located at /opt/. Ensure the file is not modified.

Solution:

bash
# Copy file to container
docker cp /tmp/nautilus.txt.gpg ubuntu_latest:/opt/

# Verify it copied correctly
docker exec ubuntu_latest ls -l /opt/nautilus.txt.gpg

# Verify file integrity (compare hashes)
docker exec ubuntu_latest sha256sum /opt/nautilus.txt.gpg
sha256sum /tmp/nautilus.txt.gpg
